#: src/postulo/plugins/postal_rules/__init__.py:85
#, draft
msgid ""
"Name each part of an address the way its own country does — State, Distrito, Prefecture — and say when something usually expected is missing. Nothing is ever refused: an address that does not fit the rules is saved exactly as typed, because plenty of real addresses do not fit any rule. Switched off, every address is free-form with neutral labels."
msgstr ""
"Vsak del naslova poimenujte tako, kot ga poimenuje njegova lastna država — State, Distrito, Prefecture — in povejte, kadar manjka nekaj, kar se običajno pričakuje. Nič ni nikoli zavrnjeno: naslov, ki se ne ujema s pravili, se shrani natanko tako, kot je bil vpisan, saj se veliko resničnih naslovov ne ujema z nobenim pravilom. Izklopljeno je vsak naslov prost, z nevtralnimi oznakami."

